4001 0 obj
<</Title(01 - Loan Books Are the New Fraud Frontier)/Dest[22 0 R/Fit]/First 4002 0 R/Last 4004 0 R/Count -3/Prev 4000 0 R/Parent 3999 0 R/Next 4005 0 R>>
endobj

4002 0 obj
<</Title(While headline fraud counts fall, value is concentrating in loan-related cases. Credit files, collateral valuations, and end-use of funds now carry the highest exposure. For auditors, the question shifts from how many frauds occurred to how much one missed red flag in lending can cost.)/Dest[22 0 R/Fit]/Parent 4001 0 R/Next 4003 0 R>>
endobj

4003 0 obj
<</Title<>/Dest[22 0 R/Fit]/Prev 4002 0 R/Parent 4001 0 R/Next 4004 0 R>>
